#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Rejected: Select Case
'Expect: compile error (this file is marked #SKIPTEST so the demo sweep ignores it):
'  Repeat For cannot use this construct inside its body because its timing is not fixed: a Call, a Wait with a variable time, Goto, Gosub, Exit Sub, Exit

#option explicit
Dim Counter As Byte
Repeat For 2000 us
    Select Case Counter
        Case 0
            Counter = 1
    End Select
    Wait 10 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
